  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under GASB 68, paragraph 57, employer contributions made after the measurement date but before the fiscal year-end are reported as deferred outflows of resources. These contributions are recognized in pension expense in the subsequent fiscal year when the next measurement period begins.
Wrong (A): Contributions after the measurement date cannot retroactively reduce the net pension liability measured as of June 30. The liability is fixed at the measurement date.
