Wrong (B): $378,000 incorrectly subtracts the $600,000 write-offs from the allowance ($1,800,000 x 21%), but write-offs reduce the allowance and are already reflected in the year-end balance.
Wrong (C): $126,000 incorrectly applies 21% to only the $600,000 written off, which is not a remaining temporary difference.
